DusdPegOracleCurve::setRuntimeChecks(bool)
├── given caller is not the current owner
│   ├── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller)
│   ├── it should leave runtimeConfigChecksEnabled unchanged
│   └── it should not emit SetRuntimeChecks
├── given caller is the pending owner but has not accepted ownership
│   ├── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller)
│   ├── it should leave runtimeConfigChecksEnabled unchanged
│   └── it should not emit SetRuntimeChecks
└── given caller is the current owner
    ├── when enabled is true and the stored value is false
    │   ├── it should set runtimeConfigChecksEnabled to true
    │   └── it should emit SetRuntimeChecks(true)
    ├── when enabled is false and the stored value is true
    │   ├── it should set runtimeConfigChecksEnabled to false
    │   └── it should emit SetRuntimeChecks(false)
    ├── when enabled equals the stored true value
    │   ├── it should keep runtimeConfigChecksEnabled true
    │   └── it should emit SetRuntimeChecks(true)
    └── when enabled equals the stored false value
        ├── it should keep runtimeConfigChecksEnabled false
        └── it should emit SetRuntimeChecks(false)
